1
00:02:40,440 --> 00:02:41,960
<font color="#ffffff">Here is a map</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

2
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:45,000
<font color="#ffffff">to the forestry radio station.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

3
00:02:46,040 --> 00:02:49,080
<font color="#ffffff">Another woman was abducted</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">at the border market.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

4
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:51,120
<font color="#ffffff">Who reported it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

5
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:53,600
<font color="#ffffff">A monk named Luang Pho Padej.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

6
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:56,200
<font color="#ffffff">PREVIOUSLY</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

7
00:02:56,280 --> 00:02:58,000
<font color="#ffffff">Impressive.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

8
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:01,160
<font color="#ffffff">Tomorrow,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

9
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:03,520
<font color="#ffffff">prepare yourself to become my wife.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

10
00:03:04,920 --> 00:03:08,640
<font color="#ffffff">Could he already know that</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Chan has that 300-million diamond?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

11
00:03:09,160 --> 00:03:11,320
<font color="#ffffff">Maybe he's holding the woman hostage.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

12
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:14,240
<font color="#ffffff">I've already sent Daeng and Pai</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to follow them.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

13
00:03:16,000 --> 00:03:17,880
<font color="#ffffff">The fake monk who was with Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

14
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:19,600
<font color="#ffffff">We haven't found Chansuek anyway.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

15
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:22,560
<font color="#ffffff">Let's tail the monk first.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

16
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:24,240
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

17
00:03:24,320 --> 00:03:25,520
<font color="#ffffff">Why did we stop?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

18
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:27,240
<font color="#ffffff">Could the area ahead be the killing field?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

19
00:03:37,480 --> 00:03:38,640
<font color="#ffffff">How can we get in?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

20
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,720
<font color="#ffffff">There are so many guards.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

21
00:03:43,200 --> 00:03:44,440
<font color="#ffffff">Exactly.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

22
00:03:46,760 --> 00:03:47,960
<font color="#ffffff">We'll just have to risk it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

23
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:50,920
<font color="#ffffff">To enter the tiger's den,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">we must become tigers.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

24
00:03:59,120 --> 00:03:59,960
<font color="#ffffff">Are you serious?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

25
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:05,800
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

26
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:24,240
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, how's everything on your side?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

27
00:04:24,320 --> 00:04:25,480
<font color="#ffffff">It's quiet over on my end.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

28
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,840
<font color="#ffffff">Same here, man.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

29
00:04:42,960 --> 00:04:44,280
<font color="#ffffff">I'm starving.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

30
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:46,480
<font color="#ffffff">I'm heading inside.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

31
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:48,160
<font color="#ffffff">Can I get you anything?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

32
00:04:49,600 --> 00:04:50,840
<font color="#ffffff">Sounds good.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

33
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:52,600
<font color="#ffffff">Bring back something tasty, all right?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

34
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:16,400
<font color="#ffffff">This camp is huge.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

35
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,680
<font color="#ffffff">Where do they keep the women?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

36
00:05:20,880 --> 00:05:21,840
<font color="#ffffff">Piya.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

37
00:05:22,520 --> 00:05:23,800
<font color="#ffffff">I think we should split up.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

38
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:25,560
<font color="#ffffff">If we stick together like this</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and get caught,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

39
00:05:25,640 --> 00:05:27,040
<font color="#ffffff">we all go down.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

40
00:05:28,160 --> 00:05:29,080
<font color="#ffffff">All right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

41
00:05:29,760 --> 00:05:31,400
<font color="#ffffff">I'll go left.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

42
00:05:31,480 --> 00:05:34,400
<font color="#ffffff">You and Ta go right.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Let's meet back here in an hour.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

43
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:35,320
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

44
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:36,240
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

45
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:07,600
<font color="#ffffff">Tofu.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

46
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:10,160
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

47
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:17,240
<font color="#ffffff">From here on out, the journey</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">is going to be incredibly dangerous.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

48
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:21,080
<font color="#ffffff">There's no telling</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">what we might run into ahead.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

49
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:26,160
<font color="#ffffff">So from now on, unless I call for you,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

50
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:28,600
<font color="#ffffff">don't come out</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">under any circumstances. Got it?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

51
00:06:30,440 --> 00:06:31,280
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

52
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:36,280
<font color="#ffffff">And if you see things go south…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

53
00:06:37,320 --> 00:06:39,600
<font color="#ffffff">What does "go south" mean?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

54
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:43,800
<font color="#ffffff">It means if I don't make it,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

55
00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:46,800
<font color="#ffffff">you have to go find someone powerful</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

56
00:06:46,880 --> 00:06:49,000
<font color="#ffffff">who can protect you from then on.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

57
00:07:01,440 --> 00:07:03,600
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, who's the monk talking to?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

58
00:07:04,160 --> 00:07:06,000
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah, I don't see anyone either.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

59
00:07:09,640 --> 00:07:12,360
<font color="#ffffff">What are you talking about, Luang Pho?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I don't get it.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

60
00:07:12,440 --> 00:07:14,440
<font color="#ffffff">I don't like this at all.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

61
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:19,800
<font color="#ffffff">Just do as I tell you, understand?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

62
00:07:32,080 --> 00:07:33,600
<font color="#ffffff">-Could it be…</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Never mind.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

63
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:35,000
<font color="#ffffff">It's nothing.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

64
00:07:35,840 --> 00:07:38,600
<font color="#ffffff">Whoever he's talking to,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">let's follow him for now.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

65
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:40,040
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

66
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:12,560
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, you!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

67
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:16,880
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah, you!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

68
00:08:18,120 --> 00:08:19,120
<font color="#ffffff">Come here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

69
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:31,000
<font color="#ffffff">What's up?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

70
00:08:36,679 --> 00:08:39,360
<font color="#ffffff">Go help move some tables and chairs</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">into the mess hall.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

71
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,640
<font color="#ffffff">-Go.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Yes, sir.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

72
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,000
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, wait!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

73
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:54,440
<font color="#ffffff">What division are you in?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

74
00:08:57,400 --> 00:08:58,400
<font color="#ffffff">Take the mask off.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

75
00:09:05,320 --> 00:09:06,440
<font color="#ffffff">I said take it off!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

76
00:09:27,640 --> 00:09:29,120
<font color="#ffffff">You don't look familiar.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

77
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:34,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'm new here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

78
00:09:36,880 --> 00:09:38,160
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, Lod!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

79
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:40,440
<font color="#ffffff">The General needs help getting dressed.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

80
00:09:40,520 --> 00:09:41,400
<font color="#ffffff">On the double!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

81
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:44,840
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

82
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:51,600
<font color="#ffffff">That was a close call.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

83
00:09:53,560 --> 00:09:54,400
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

84
00:09:54,920 --> 00:09:56,000
<font color="#ffffff">Carry the things!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

85
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:58,160
<font color="#ffffff">Move!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

86
00:09:59,560 --> 00:10:03,880
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, what kind of banquet is this?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I just got here recently.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

87
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:06,680
<font color="#ffffff">The General's wedding.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

88
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:10,600
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know what he sees</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in that Thai woman prisoner.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

89
00:10:11,640 --> 00:10:13,960
<font color="#ffffff">The preparations for the wedding have been</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">keeping us awake all night!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

90
00:10:16,040 --> 00:10:17,080
<font color="#ffffff">Wedding?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

91
00:10:17,880 --> 00:10:18,840
<font color="#ffffff">Yeah.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

92
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:21,760
<font color="#ffffff">Go move the stuff.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

93
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:29,080
<font color="#ffffff">What's this all about?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

94
00:11:20,280 --> 00:11:21,200
<font color="#ffffff">Who is that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

95
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:23,840
<font color="#ffffff">The General told me</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to bring these ornaments to the bride.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

96
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:34,200
<font color="#ffffff">Where are the ornaments?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

97
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:43,840
<font color="#ffffff">-Hey.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Boonrod.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

98
00:11:44,440 --> 00:11:45,760
<font color="#ffffff">Are you saving me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

99
00:11:47,240 --> 00:11:48,480
<font color="#ffffff">I thought you were captured.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

100
00:11:48,560 --> 00:11:50,320
<font color="#ffffff">How did you end up getting married?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

101
00:11:50,400 --> 00:11:52,360
<font color="#ffffff">I was forced into it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

102
00:11:53,800 --> 00:11:57,000
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, stop asking questions.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Where is Luang Pho?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

103
00:11:57,720 --> 00:12:00,280
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho went to get the authorities.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I came on ahead.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

104
00:12:00,360 --> 00:12:01,280
<font color="#ffffff">Let's get you out.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

105
00:12:01,920 --> 00:12:03,400
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

106
00:12:03,480 --> 00:12:04,840
<font color="#ffffff">-Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Watch out!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

107
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:11,120
<font color="#ffffff">-Go!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Let's go!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

108
00:12:11,200 --> 00:12:12,120
<font color="#ffffff">Go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

109
00:12:22,240 --> 00:12:24,200
<font color="#ffffff">-Wait, hold on!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-What?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

110
00:12:24,280 --> 00:12:27,000
<font color="#ffffff">We need to rescue all the women</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">who were captured.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

111
00:12:27,520 --> 00:12:29,160
<font color="#ffffff">Right, where are they?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

112
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:30,480
<font color="#ffffff">They're over there.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

113
00:12:31,280 --> 00:12:32,920
<font color="#ffffff">-Let's move!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Okay.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

114
00:12:46,680 --> 00:12:47,800
<font color="#ffffff">Piya.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

115
00:12:47,880 --> 00:12:50,400
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod, run! Don't worry about me!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

116
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:53,880
<font color="#ffffff">Noona.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

117
00:12:54,680 --> 00:12:57,000
<font color="#ffffff">I've given you so many chances.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

118
00:12:57,720 --> 00:13:00,960
<font color="#ffffff">Why won't you take the opportunities</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I've given you?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

119
00:13:01,560 --> 00:13:03,520
<font color="#ffffff">How could you do this to me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

120
00:13:05,880 --> 00:13:07,680
<font color="#ffffff">And who the hell is this guy?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

121
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:17,480
<font color="#ffffff">He's my husband.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

122
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:19,720
<font color="#ffffff">What? Hey.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

123
00:13:26,680 --> 00:13:30,560
<font color="#ffffff">How could you hurt me like this</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">over and over again?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

124
00:13:30,640 --> 00:13:33,160
<font color="#ffffff">Lock them up together!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

125
00:13:33,920 --> 00:13:37,720
<font color="#ffffff">Then I'll decide exactly</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">how to get my revenge.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

126
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:43,000
<font color="#ffffff">Get them!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

127
00:13:44,040 --> 00:13:45,760
<font color="#ffffff">-Come here!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Get off me!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

128
00:13:45,840 --> 00:13:46,720
<font color="#ffffff">Come!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

129
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:48,720
<font color="#ffffff">-Walk!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Let go of me!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

130
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:51,800
<font color="#ffffff">BAN DAO DAP POLICE STATION</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

131
00:14:01,080 --> 00:14:02,840
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, hello, Mr. Papon!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

132
00:14:02,920 --> 00:14:04,840
<font color="#ffffff">Are you here on vacation?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

133
00:14:05,520 --> 00:14:06,920
<font color="#ffffff">What do you want?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

134
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:11,000
<font color="#ffffff">My bad! I didn't mean to do that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

135
00:14:11,080 --> 00:14:13,880
<font color="#ffffff">Are you looking for trouble,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Kamnan Sawaeng?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

136
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:15,280
<font color="#ffffff">Come on…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

137
00:14:16,320 --> 00:14:17,440
<font color="#ffffff">Who would dare?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

138
00:14:17,520 --> 00:14:18,920
<font color="#ffffff">Don't be like that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

139
00:14:19,560 --> 00:14:21,520
<font color="#ffffff">All right, since you're in my town,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

140
00:14:21,600 --> 00:14:23,200
<font color="#ffffff">let me welcome you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

141
00:14:23,720 --> 00:14:26,120
<font color="#ffffff">-I'll show you around.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Don't mess with me.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

142
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:29,240
<font color="#ffffff">Watch yourself.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

143
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:31,720
<font color="#ffffff">As long as I'm here,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

144
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:35,760
<font color="#ffffff">I won't let anyone be above the law.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

145
00:14:50,680 --> 00:14:52,000
<font color="#ffffff">Is everyone okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

146
00:14:52,080 --> 00:14:53,160
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

147
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:55,320
<font color="#ffffff">Hey.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

148
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:58,760
<font color="#ffffff">Why did you come to help me?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Why didn't you escape with Luang Pho?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

149
00:14:59,360 --> 00:15:00,600
<font color="#ffffff">Are you crazy?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

150
00:15:00,680 --> 00:15:03,800
<font color="#ffffff">How could I abandon you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">when you didn't leave me?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

151
00:15:03,880 --> 00:15:06,920
<font color="#ffffff">We've come this far.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Only a traitor would walk away now.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

152
00:15:09,640 --> 00:15:11,360
<font color="#ffffff">Right. Thank you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

153
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:16,480
<font color="#ffffff">I'm sorry for getting you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">involved in this.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

154
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:18,560
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry about it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

155
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:21,400
<font color="#ffffff">Besides you, my people were also captured.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

156
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:23,640
<font color="#ffffff">Exactly.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

157
00:15:26,560 --> 00:15:28,080
<font color="#ffffff">So where is Luang Pho now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

158
00:15:30,680 --> 00:15:32,880
<font color="#ffffff">He's looking for backup,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

159
00:15:32,960 --> 00:15:34,520
<font color="#ffffff">but who knows what's happening by now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

160
00:15:37,400 --> 00:15:38,320
<font color="#ffffff">Open the door!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

161
00:15:43,360 --> 00:15:44,840
<font color="#ffffff">Move.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

162
00:15:44,920 --> 00:15:46,240
<font color="#ffffff">Both of you, get out.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

163
00:15:46,320 --> 00:15:48,400
<font color="#ffffff">Hey! Where are you taking them?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

164
00:15:48,920 --> 00:15:50,600
<font color="#ffffff">You don't need to know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

165
00:15:50,680 --> 00:15:52,160
<font color="#ffffff">You're next anyway.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

166
00:15:52,840 --> 00:15:53,760
<font color="#ffffff">Step back.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

167
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:56,840
<font color="#ffffff">Move!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

168
00:15:59,400 --> 00:16:00,240
<font color="#ffffff">Move!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

169
00:16:12,120 --> 00:16:13,480
<font color="#ffffff">Don't tell me…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

170
00:16:45,520 --> 00:16:47,840
<font color="#ffffff">-Go on, move!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Yeah.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

171
00:16:56,080 --> 00:16:57,280
<font color="#ffffff">There you are.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

172
00:16:57,880 --> 00:16:59,480
<font color="#ffffff">Why did you bring me here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

173
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:05,119
<font color="#ffffff">I just wanted you and your husband</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to enjoy the show.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

174
00:17:07,079 --> 00:17:08,319
<font color="#ffffff">What kind of show?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

175
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:11,119
<font color="#ffffff">Playing tag or something?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

176
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:14,000
<font color="#ffffff">Move!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

177
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:17,319
<font color="#ffffff">Please don't hurt me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

178
00:17:17,400 --> 00:17:18,720
<font color="#ffffff">My kid is still a baby.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

179
00:17:18,800 --> 00:17:20,240
<font color="#ffffff">Please let me go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

180
00:17:20,319 --> 00:17:24,560
<font color="#ffffff">All right, listen up, you bastards.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

181
00:17:26,040 --> 00:17:29,640
<font color="#ffffff">This is your last chance to go home.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

182
00:17:31,840 --> 00:17:34,720
<font color="#ffffff">If you can make it across this field,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

183
00:17:35,560 --> 00:17:36,960
<font color="#ffffff">you're free to go home.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

184
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:42,720
<font color="#ffffff">As soon as I signal…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

185
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:45,240
<font color="#ffffff">-You run like hell!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Okay.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

186
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:49,320
<font color="#ffffff">Make it to that red flag in 30 seconds</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

187
00:17:50,480 --> 00:17:51,920
<font color="#ffffff">to see your kid again.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

188
00:17:57,080 --> 00:17:58,200
<font color="#ffffff">Go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

189
00:18:11,680 --> 00:18:12,560
<font color="#ffffff">What the…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

190
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:20,440
<font color="#ffffff">First round, and I won it all.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

191
00:18:20,520 --> 00:18:21,880
<font color="#ffffff">Damn it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

192
00:18:24,360 --> 00:18:26,880
<font color="#ffffff">This is a killing field.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

193
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:28,280
<font color="#ffffff">That's right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

194
00:18:28,360 --> 00:18:29,200
<font color="#ffffff">This is it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

195
00:18:29,280 --> 00:18:31,520
<font color="#ffffff">The infamous killing field.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

196
00:18:32,520 --> 00:18:35,440
<font color="#ffffff">Over a hundred mines are buried here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

197
00:18:35,520 --> 00:18:38,600
<font color="#ffffff">Anyone who gets through</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">is one lucky bastard.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

198
00:18:38,680 --> 00:18:40,480
<font color="#ffffff">They earn their freedom.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

199
00:18:41,880 --> 00:18:43,640
<font color="#ffffff">But so far…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

200
00:18:44,240 --> 00:18:45,480
<font color="#ffffff">I haven't seen a winner.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

201
00:18:48,120 --> 00:18:48,960
<font color="#ffffff">Move!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

202
00:18:49,520 --> 00:18:51,400
<font color="#ffffff">-Come on!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Wait!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

203
00:18:52,600 --> 00:18:54,240
<font color="#ffffff">Run!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

204
00:19:04,280 --> 00:19:07,840
<font color="#ffffff">What does a human life mean to you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

205
00:19:07,920 --> 00:19:10,440
<font color="#ffffff">Is this fun for you?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Someone just died right there!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

206
00:19:13,120 --> 00:19:14,120
<font color="#ffffff">Time's up.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

207
00:19:22,440 --> 00:19:24,760
<font color="#ffffff">You monsters! You sick bastards!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

208
00:19:25,360 --> 00:19:28,960
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, look who's getting angry now!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

209
00:19:30,320 --> 00:19:31,480
<font color="#ffffff">You hellbound bastards!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

210
00:19:31,560 --> 00:19:32,720
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

211
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:37,240
<font color="#ffffff">This guy speaks my language.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

212
00:19:37,320 --> 00:19:38,720
<font color="#ffffff">Take him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

213
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:39,960
<font color="#ffffff">-No!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Come here!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

214
00:19:40,040 --> 00:19:40,880
<font color="#ffffff">Get off me!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

215
00:19:40,960 --> 00:19:41,840
<font color="#ffffff">-Move!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Let go!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

216
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:44,840
<font color="#ffffff">-Noona.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Boonrod.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

217
00:19:46,680 --> 00:19:47,760
<font color="#ffffff">Go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

218
00:19:47,840 --> 00:19:49,160
<font color="#ffffff">Don't go, Boonrod!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

219
00:19:51,800 --> 00:19:52,800
<font color="#ffffff">Don't go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

220
00:19:56,200 --> 00:19:57,040
<font color="#ffffff">Move!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

221
00:19:59,000 --> 00:20:00,200
<font color="#ffffff">Wait!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

222
00:20:07,760 --> 00:20:09,080
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

223
00:20:16,760 --> 00:20:17,840
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

224
00:20:20,560 --> 00:20:23,040
<font color="#ffffff">Sir, I found this monk outside the camp.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

225
00:20:23,560 --> 00:20:26,480
<font color="#ffffff">He wants us to release his people, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

226
00:20:37,680 --> 00:20:39,080
<font color="#ffffff">What a tragedy…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

227
00:20:40,800 --> 00:20:43,480
<font color="#ffffff">Is this really what humans</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

228
00:20:43,560 --> 00:20:45,160
<font color="#ffffff">do to one another?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

229
00:20:45,800 --> 00:20:47,120
<font color="#ffffff">What brings you here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

230
00:20:48,840 --> 00:20:50,600
<font color="#ffffff">I ask</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

231
00:20:51,200 --> 00:20:53,280
<font color="#ffffff">for your mercy.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

232
00:20:53,360 --> 00:20:55,320
<font color="#ffffff">Please release all the captured people.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

233
00:21:01,120 --> 00:21:03,880
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho. Please just leave!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

234
00:21:04,480 --> 00:21:05,520
<font color="#ffffff">They won't negotiate with you!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

235
00:21:09,920 --> 00:21:12,040
<font color="#ffffff">Are these two your disciples?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

236
00:21:14,240 --> 00:21:15,680
<font color="#ffffff">They're both trouble.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

237
00:21:19,080 --> 00:21:20,920
<font color="#ffffff">Will you trade my life for them?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

238
00:21:28,600 --> 00:21:31,160
<font color="#ffffff">What would I do with a monk?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

239
00:21:31,880 --> 00:21:33,120
<font color="#ffffff">No deal!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

240
00:21:33,200 --> 00:21:34,600
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, grab the monk!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

241
00:21:34,680 --> 00:21:36,080
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, hold on!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

242
00:21:39,200 --> 00:21:42,080
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not religious,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

243
00:21:42,160 --> 00:21:43,680
<font color="#ffffff">but even I know</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

244
00:21:43,760 --> 00:21:46,200
<font color="#ffffff">a monk is a man of virtue.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

245
00:21:46,280 --> 00:21:47,640
<font color="#ffffff">A good person.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

246
00:21:48,280 --> 00:21:51,440
<font color="#ffffff">You have no stake in this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

247
00:21:52,040 --> 00:21:54,040
<font color="#ffffff">Since you asked,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

248
00:21:54,120 --> 00:21:57,280
<font color="#ffffff">it would be rude not to hear you out.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

249
00:21:59,600 --> 00:22:00,840
<font color="#ffffff">How about this?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

250
00:22:01,480 --> 00:22:05,760
<font color="#ffffff">You and your disciples</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">can walk through this killing field.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

251
00:22:12,840 --> 00:22:15,040
<font color="#ffffff">If you can work a miracle</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

252
00:22:15,120 --> 00:22:17,600
<font color="#ffffff">and get this young man safely</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">across the minefield,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

253
00:22:18,240 --> 00:22:21,760
<font color="#ffffff">I will release every single prisoner</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in this camp.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

254
00:22:22,800 --> 00:22:23,680
<font color="#ffffff">Do we have a deal?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

255
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:28,440
<font color="#ffffff">No, Luang Pho!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Please, don't listen to him!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

256
00:22:29,440 --> 00:22:30,440
<font color="#ffffff">She's right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

257
00:22:31,480 --> 00:22:32,560
<font color="#ffffff">Please go back, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

258
00:22:33,200 --> 00:22:34,560
<font color="#ffffff">Just let me die alone.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

259
00:22:35,120 --> 00:22:36,120
<font color="#ffffff">Please, just leave.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

260
00:22:39,360 --> 00:22:40,360
<font color="#ffffff">Your call, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

261
00:22:44,480 --> 00:22:45,880
<font color="#ffffff">I accept.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

262
00:22:52,160 --> 00:22:53,920
<font color="#ffffff">Wait! Luang Pho!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

263
00:23:19,440 --> 00:23:21,200
<font color="#ffffff">We are now outside the Thai border.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

264
00:23:21,280 --> 00:23:23,240
<font color="#ffffff">From here on out, this is a black op.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

265
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:25,760
<font color="#ffffff">We're on our own.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

266
00:23:26,560 --> 00:23:27,560
<font color="#ffffff">Damn.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

267
00:23:27,640 --> 00:23:28,760
<font color="#ffffff">How do we get in then?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

268
00:23:29,680 --> 00:23:31,000
<font color="#ffffff">It's a death sentence.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

269
00:23:32,040 --> 00:23:35,200
<font color="#ffffff">Shouldn't we try negotiating first?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

270
00:23:37,560 --> 00:23:38,960
<font color="#ffffff">If negotiation were possible,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

271
00:23:39,720 --> 00:23:41,960
<font color="#ffffff">we wouldn't be in daily conflict.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

272
00:23:44,240 --> 00:23:45,960
<font color="#ffffff">Everyone, stay here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

273
00:23:46,800 --> 00:23:48,040
<font color="#ffffff">I'm going in with the Chief.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

274
00:23:49,600 --> 00:23:50,640
<font color="#ffffff">If anything happens,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

275
00:23:50,720 --> 00:23:52,200
<font color="#ffffff">I'll radio you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

276
00:23:53,760 --> 00:23:54,960
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go, Captain.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

277
00:24:16,880 --> 00:24:18,720
<font color="#ffffff">The captain and his men must be here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

278
00:24:19,440 --> 00:24:21,400
<font color="#ffffff">They're likely lying in wait around here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

279
00:24:22,280 --> 00:24:23,640
<font color="#ffffff">I say we move in now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

280
00:24:24,560 --> 00:24:26,840
<font color="#ffffff">Otherwise, they'll get him first.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

281
00:24:27,480 --> 00:24:29,280
<font color="#ffffff">-Go!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Wait!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

282
00:24:29,360 --> 00:24:31,360
<font color="#ffffff">Didn't your dad ever teach you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

283
00:24:31,440 --> 00:24:33,280
<font color="#ffffff">Don't fight a losing battle.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

284
00:24:36,880 --> 00:24:37,720
<font color="#ffffff">Daeng,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

285
00:24:38,400 --> 00:24:40,160
<font color="#ffffff">go get Chansuek now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

286
00:24:40,920 --> 00:24:42,440
<font color="#ffffff">Signal if anything goes wrong.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

287
00:24:44,280 --> 00:24:45,120
<font color="#ffffff">Jer.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

288
00:24:45,920 --> 00:24:46,840
<font color="#ffffff">Go with him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

289
00:24:46,920 --> 00:24:47,840
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

290
00:24:57,040 --> 00:24:59,040
<font color="#ffffff">Since you're a monk,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

291
00:24:59,120 --> 00:25:01,480
<font color="#ffffff">I'll give you three more minutes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

292
00:25:05,840 --> 00:25:06,720
<font color="#ffffff">Go ahead.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

293
00:25:06,800 --> 00:25:07,800
<font color="#ffffff">Go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

294
00:25:10,960 --> 00:25:12,240
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

295
00:25:12,320 --> 00:25:13,480
<font color="#ffffff">Go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

296
00:25:25,760 --> 00:25:26,600
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

297
00:25:27,240 --> 00:25:29,000
<font color="#ffffff">Why did you have to go this far?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

298
00:25:30,240 --> 00:25:33,200
<font color="#ffffff">If I hadn't done it, you'd be dead by now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

299
00:25:33,280 --> 00:25:35,520
<font color="#ffffff">How does that change anything?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

300
00:25:35,600 --> 00:25:38,600
<font color="#ffffff">It's just one more dead body.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

301
00:25:40,400 --> 00:25:42,200
<font color="#ffffff">At least,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

302
00:25:42,280 --> 00:25:44,400
<font color="#ffffff">I bought us some time.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

303
00:25:45,400 --> 00:25:46,720
<font color="#ffffff">How did that buy us time?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

304
00:25:46,800 --> 00:25:48,280
<font color="#ffffff">Look out there!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

305
00:25:48,360 --> 00:25:50,480
<font color="#ffffff">We take one step and boom!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

306
00:25:53,120 --> 00:25:54,600
<font color="#ffffff">This has gone too far.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

307
00:25:55,360 --> 00:25:56,960
<font color="#ffffff">I beg you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

308
00:25:57,040 --> 00:25:58,720
<font color="#ffffff">Please spare his life.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

309
00:25:58,800 --> 00:26:00,160
<font color="#ffffff">He's a monk.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

310
00:26:02,160 --> 00:26:04,320
<font color="#ffffff">That's exactly why.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

311
00:26:04,400 --> 00:26:06,640
<font color="#ffffff">Let's put him to the test</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

312
00:26:06,720 --> 00:26:10,960
<font color="#ffffff">and see if he's a real monk</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">with holy powers.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

313
00:26:15,440 --> 00:26:17,320
<font color="#ffffff">You bastards.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

314
00:26:17,400 --> 00:26:18,840
<font color="#ffffff">You people are truly evil.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

315
00:26:19,440 --> 00:26:20,720
<font color="#ffffff">Evil? Oh, I'm so evil.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

316
00:26:29,200 --> 00:26:31,000
<font color="#ffffff">Just so you know…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

317
00:26:31,080 --> 00:26:36,000
<font color="#ffffff">those are M14 mines buried down there.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

318
00:26:37,000 --> 00:26:39,160
<font color="#ffffff">They're detonated by a fuse.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

319
00:26:41,280 --> 00:26:45,560
<font color="#ffffff">Are you giving me a lecture right now?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I don't want to die. I want to live!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

320
00:26:45,640 --> 00:26:46,960
<font color="#ffffff">It's not a good time!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

321
00:26:47,600 --> 00:26:51,240
<font color="#ffffff">If you feel like you've stepped on a mine,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

322
00:26:51,320 --> 00:26:53,360
<font color="#ffffff">do not lift your foot.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

323
00:26:53,440 --> 00:26:57,680
<font color="#ffffff">If you lift it,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">it will detonate instantly.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

324
00:26:58,200 --> 00:27:01,840
<font color="#ffffff">Teach me how to avoid them instead!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

325
00:27:01,920 --> 00:27:03,920
<font color="#ffffff">There's no way around it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

326
00:27:04,520 --> 00:27:06,640
<font color="#ffffff">Look, Luang Pho! Just look around you!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

327
00:27:07,360 --> 00:27:09,080
<font color="#ffffff">I can't tell where to step!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

328
00:27:09,160 --> 00:27:11,640
<font color="#ffffff">Please, just tell me. I don't want to die.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

329
00:27:11,720 --> 00:27:15,200
<font color="#ffffff">-Is there any way out?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Just shut up.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

330
00:27:15,760 --> 00:27:16,680
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, come on.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

331
00:27:18,400 --> 00:27:21,600
<font color="#ffffff">Focus on your breathing. Get a grip.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

332
00:27:22,680 --> 00:27:24,200
<font color="#ffffff">Open your eyes,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

333
00:27:25,160 --> 00:27:26,720
<font color="#ffffff">and you'll see.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

334
00:27:31,320 --> 00:27:34,960
<font color="#ffffff">The people who planted the mines</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">are human just like us.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

335
00:27:35,040 --> 00:27:37,760
<font color="#ffffff">They don't want their men</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">stepping on them either.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

336
00:27:38,360 --> 00:27:40,760
<font color="#ffffff">Every time they plant a mine,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

337
00:27:40,840 --> 00:27:43,640
<font color="#ffffff">they leave a landmark</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for their own men to see.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

338
00:27:46,480 --> 00:27:49,000
<font color="#ffffff">In a mine-filled open field like this,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

339
00:27:49,080 --> 00:27:52,240
<font color="#ffffff">they definitely left markers behind.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

340
00:27:53,920 --> 00:27:55,040
<font color="#ffffff">Look closely.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

341
00:28:19,640 --> 00:28:20,480
<font color="#ffffff">I see it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

342
00:28:22,920 --> 00:28:23,760
<font color="#ffffff">It's…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

343
00:28:24,400 --> 00:28:25,360
<font color="#ffffff">There are twigs…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

344
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:27,120
<font color="#ffffff">and pebbles.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

345
00:28:27,200 --> 00:28:28,600
<font color="#ffffff">Right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

346
00:28:28,680 --> 00:28:30,320
<font color="#ffffff">Learning fast, aren't you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

347
00:28:30,400 --> 00:28:31,800
<font color="#ffffff">But Luang Pho…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

348
00:28:32,400 --> 00:28:33,240
<font color="#ffffff">It's…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

349
00:28:34,080 --> 00:28:36,160
<font color="#ffffff">Are they all marked the same way?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

350
00:28:36,240 --> 00:28:38,280
<font color="#ffffff">Get your ass moving! Go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

351
00:28:39,960 --> 00:28:41,600
<font color="#ffffff">Move, or I'll shoot you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

352
00:28:51,960 --> 00:28:53,400
<font color="#ffffff">Follow me closely.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

353
00:28:55,880 --> 00:28:57,200
<font color="#ffffff">Watch your step.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

354
00:29:23,000 --> 00:29:26,920
<font color="#ffffff">Sin, when accumulated, brings misery.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

355
00:29:27,560 --> 00:29:29,040
<font color="#ffffff">Sin…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

356
00:29:29,120 --> 00:29:30,800
<font color="#ffffff">when accumulated…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

357
00:29:30,880 --> 00:29:33,280
<font color="#ffffff">brings misery.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

358
00:29:34,080 --> 00:29:35,800
<font color="#ffffff">-Sin…</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Luang Pho.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

359
00:29:35,880 --> 00:29:40,160
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho, is that a mine-proof spell?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

360
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:41,120
<font color="#ffffff">What was the chant?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

361
00:29:41,200 --> 00:29:45,200
<font color="#ffffff">Sin, when accumulated, brings misery.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

362
00:29:45,280 --> 00:29:47,800
<font color="#ffffff">-Brings misery.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-It means…<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

363
00:29:47,880 --> 00:29:50,360
<font color="#ffffff">to amass sin…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

364
00:29:51,560 --> 00:29:54,480
<font color="#ffffff">is to amass suffering.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

365
00:29:54,560 --> 00:29:57,720
<font color="#ffffff">And to amass suffering is to amass sin.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

366
00:29:58,360 --> 00:29:59,800
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

367
00:30:00,400 --> 00:30:02,520
<font color="#ffffff">This is no time for a sermon!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

368
00:30:03,280 --> 00:30:07,040
<font color="#ffffff">We need to activate the magic! The magic!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

369
00:30:07,680 --> 00:30:12,840
<font color="#ffffff">Be quiet. Stay close to me</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and watch your step.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

370
00:30:13,560 --> 00:30:15,560
<font color="#ffffff">Sin, when accumulated…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

371
00:30:17,800 --> 00:30:19,120
<font color="#ffffff">Focus on your breath.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

372
00:30:23,680 --> 00:30:26,920
<font color="#ffffff">Good job. Well done, Boonrod.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

373
00:30:46,280 --> 00:30:47,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'll go first.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

374
00:30:48,160 --> 00:30:49,800
<font color="#ffffff">I'll signal if something's off.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

375
00:30:50,440 --> 00:30:51,840
<font color="#ffffff">Be careful, Captain.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

376
00:31:11,640 --> 00:31:12,920
<font color="#ffffff">Let's split up and find him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

377
00:31:19,400 --> 00:31:20,680
<font color="#ffffff">Just breathe.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

378
00:31:26,880 --> 00:31:28,800
<font color="#ffffff">Making it this far</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

379
00:31:29,520 --> 00:31:31,600
<font color="#ffffff">means he's really something.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

380
00:31:36,440 --> 00:31:38,360
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

381
00:31:39,160 --> 00:31:42,200
<font color="#ffffff">What about the backup you radioed for?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

382
00:31:42,280 --> 00:31:43,680
<font color="#ffffff">Aren't they here yet?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

383
00:31:45,400 --> 00:31:48,080
<font color="#ffffff">-How should I know?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-What?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

384
00:31:48,160 --> 00:31:51,800
<font color="#ffffff">Don't you have some</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">divine sight or foresight?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

385
00:31:51,880 --> 00:31:56,200
<font color="#ffffff">Of course I don't!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I'm just an ordinary monk, for God's sake!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

386
00:31:56,800 --> 00:31:57,640
<font color="#ffffff">Seriously?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

387
00:32:03,600 --> 00:32:06,160
<font color="#ffffff">-We're halfway there.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-What?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

388
00:32:06,240 --> 00:32:07,760
<font color="#ffffff">-Only halfway?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Yeah.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

389
00:32:07,840 --> 00:32:09,920
<font color="#ffffff">This half feels as long</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">as half a lifetime.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

390
00:32:10,520 --> 00:32:12,760
<font color="#ffffff">They've made it halfway, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

391
00:32:12,840 --> 00:32:14,920
<font color="#ffffff">That monk is impossible to kill.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

392
00:32:15,000 --> 00:32:17,000
<font color="#ffffff">Are you really letting the hostages go?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

393
00:32:17,080 --> 00:32:18,840
<font color="#ffffff">They're worth a lot of money.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

394
00:32:38,280 --> 00:32:39,440
<font color="#ffffff">-Whoa!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Boonrod!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

395
00:32:39,520 --> 00:32:40,440
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

396
00:32:48,920 --> 00:32:50,040
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

397
00:32:59,000 --> 00:33:00,520
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

398
00:33:02,120 --> 00:33:05,440
<font color="#ffffff">It seems I've stepped on a mine.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

399
00:33:09,760 --> 00:33:11,400
<font color="#ffffff">A mine?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

400
00:33:12,680 --> 00:33:14,120
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, a landmine!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

401
00:33:19,120 --> 00:33:21,600
<font color="#ffffff">Who the hell said he was going to make it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

402
00:33:35,240 --> 00:33:36,200
<font color="#ffffff">Landmine!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

403
00:33:37,720 --> 00:33:39,000
<font color="#ffffff">I can't move.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

404
00:33:41,160 --> 00:33:42,080
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

405
00:33:42,880 --> 00:33:44,440
<font color="#ffffff">If anything happens to me,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

406
00:33:44,520 --> 00:33:47,400
<font color="#ffffff">run back to the cave</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">where you first found me.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

407
00:33:48,120 --> 00:33:49,480
<font color="#ffffff">Inside that cave…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

408
00:33:49,560 --> 00:33:51,200
<font color="#ffffff">-There's…</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Wait!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

409
00:33:51,280 --> 00:33:53,400
<font color="#ffffff">This is no time for a goodbye!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

410
00:33:54,120 --> 00:33:56,920
<font color="#ffffff">You're going to be fine.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">You're not dying today!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

411
00:33:57,920 --> 00:33:58,960
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

412
00:34:00,200 --> 00:34:03,680
<font color="#ffffff">Just stay calm. Don't move, okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

413
00:34:03,760 --> 00:34:04,920
<font color="#ffffff">Just stay still.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

414
00:34:05,720 --> 00:34:06,920
<font color="#ffffff">What are we going to do?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

415
00:34:14,040 --> 00:34:15,320
<font color="#ffffff">They're taking too damn long.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

416
00:34:16,560 --> 00:34:17,600
<font color="#ffffff">I'll go check.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

417
00:34:34,880 --> 00:34:36,040
<font color="#ffffff">Where did the shots come from?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

418
00:34:37,120 --> 00:34:38,600
<font color="#ffffff">They're shooting!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

419
00:34:39,920 --> 00:34:40,800
<font color="#ffffff">Why did you shoot?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

420
00:34:40,880 --> 00:34:42,800
<font color="#ffffff">He was aiming at me! What else could I do?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

421
00:34:50,159 --> 00:34:52,400
<font color="#ffffff">What happened?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Go see what's going on, Lod!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

422
00:34:52,480 --> 00:34:53,320
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

423
00:35:20,160 --> 00:35:22,240
<font color="#ffffff">We're under attack!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know who they are!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

424
00:35:23,040 --> 00:35:24,320
<font color="#ffffff">-Move!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Let's go!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

425
00:35:31,880 --> 00:35:33,120
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

426
00:35:34,440 --> 00:35:36,200
<font color="#ffffff">Get Luang Pho out of there.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

427
00:35:37,240 --> 00:35:38,480
<font color="#ffffff">We can't!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

428
00:35:38,560 --> 00:35:39,800
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho has stepped on a landmine!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

429
00:35:40,480 --> 00:35:41,800
<font color="#ffffff">We're stuck!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

430
00:35:41,880 --> 00:35:43,640
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

431
00:35:44,160 --> 00:35:45,480
<font color="#ffffff">Tofu!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

432
00:35:45,560 --> 00:35:47,040
<font color="#ffffff">Why are you out here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

433
00:35:47,120 --> 00:35:49,280
<font color="#ffffff">I didn't tell you to come out!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

434
00:35:50,080 --> 00:35:52,160
<font color="#ffffff">But I'm worried about you!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

435
00:35:52,240 --> 00:35:53,920
<font color="#ffffff">Go back! Right now!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

436
00:35:54,000 --> 00:35:55,360
<font color="#ffffff">Just go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

437
00:35:55,440 --> 00:35:57,200
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

438
00:35:59,000 --> 00:35:59,840
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

439
00:35:59,920 --> 00:36:01,240
<font color="#ffffff">Are you talking to me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

440
00:36:01,760 --> 00:36:03,240
<font color="#ffffff">Yes!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

441
00:36:04,120 --> 00:36:07,080
<font color="#ffffff">Just take Noona and run!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

442
00:36:07,160 --> 00:36:10,080
<font color="#ffffff">Go back the way we came! Now, go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

443
00:36:10,160 --> 00:36:13,840
<font color="#ffffff">No! You won't leave me,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and I won't leave you!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

444
00:36:14,840 --> 00:36:19,040
<font color="#ffffff">For God's sake, run!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Or you'll be blown up too!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

445
00:36:19,120 --> 00:36:20,760
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not leaving you!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

446
00:36:20,840 --> 00:36:23,400
<font color="#ffffff">Teach me how to disarm it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

447
00:36:23,480 --> 00:36:25,160
<font color="#ffffff">It's not that easy!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

448
00:36:25,240 --> 00:36:27,560
<font color="#ffffff">If you screw up, we both die!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

449
00:36:27,640 --> 00:36:29,120
<font color="#ffffff">Then so be it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

450
00:36:30,840 --> 00:36:32,280
<font color="#ffffff">If it weren't for you…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

451
00:36:32,360 --> 00:36:34,320
<font color="#ffffff">I wouldn't be standing here today.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

452
00:36:35,360 --> 00:36:37,040
<font color="#ffffff">-Oh, you stubborn kid.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-What?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

453
00:36:38,840 --> 00:36:39,680
<font color="#ffffff">Okay, listen.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

454
00:36:40,280 --> 00:36:42,560
<font color="#ffffff">I need something thin. A piece of metal.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

455
00:36:42,640 --> 00:36:44,400
<font color="#ffffff">A knife, anything! Get it for me now!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

456
00:36:45,120 --> 00:36:48,760
<font color="#ffffff">What knife? They took everything!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I've got nothing on me!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

457
00:36:48,840 --> 00:36:51,120
<font color="#ffffff">I told you, it's not that easy.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

458
00:36:59,600 --> 00:37:00,440
<font color="#ffffff">Noona!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

459
00:37:02,320 --> 00:37:04,360
<font color="#ffffff">Do you have a knife? Find me a knife!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

460
00:37:05,600 --> 00:37:07,120
<font color="#ffffff">-A knife?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Yes.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

461
00:37:16,640 --> 00:37:17,480
<font color="#ffffff">Here, take it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

462
00:37:17,560 --> 00:37:18,720
<font color="#ffffff">Pass it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

463
00:37:27,280 --> 00:37:28,280
<font color="#ffffff">Noona,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

464
00:37:28,960 --> 00:37:30,440
<font color="#ffffff">they're distracted!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

465
00:37:30,520 --> 00:37:32,080
<font color="#ffffff">Go! Help the others now!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

466
00:37:37,080 --> 00:37:40,280
<font color="#ffffff">Promise me you'll both be safe. Please.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

467
00:37:41,160 --> 00:37:42,280
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

468
00:37:43,600 --> 00:37:44,840
<font color="#ffffff">Promise me, for real.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

469
00:37:45,960 --> 00:37:46,920
<font color="#ffffff">I promise.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

470
00:37:58,160 --> 00:38:00,040
<font color="#ffffff">Stay still, Luang Pho. Don't move.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

471
00:38:01,280 --> 00:38:02,160
<font color="#ffffff">Stay still.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

472
00:38:18,840 --> 00:38:21,000
<font color="#ffffff">Stay still, Luang Pho. Just stay still.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

473
00:38:22,760 --> 00:38:24,120
<font color="#ffffff">Do you remember what to do?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

474
00:38:27,920 --> 00:38:29,440
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not sure either.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

475
00:38:52,040 --> 00:38:52,920
<font color="#ffffff">Lieutenant.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

476
00:38:54,440 --> 00:38:55,840
<font color="#ffffff">Should we help the captain?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

477
00:38:56,440 --> 00:38:57,280
<font color="#ffffff">No.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

478
00:38:58,320 --> 00:38:59,880
<font color="#ffffff">We stay here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

479
00:39:27,560 --> 00:39:29,000
<font color="#ffffff">Stay calm.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

480
00:39:32,560 --> 00:39:33,760
<font color="#ffffff">Take it slow.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

481
00:39:43,800 --> 00:39:44,640
<font color="#ffffff">Captain!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

482
00:39:45,680 --> 00:39:46,640
<font color="#ffffff">What's wrong?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

483
00:39:46,720 --> 00:39:48,760
<font color="#ffffff">I think I'm standing on a landmine.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

484
00:39:49,960 --> 00:39:51,000
<font color="#ffffff">Stay calm.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

485
00:39:51,680 --> 00:39:52,520
<font color="#ffffff">Don't move!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

486
00:40:09,800 --> 00:40:11,000
<font color="#ffffff">Stay absolutely still.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

487
00:40:12,000 --> 00:40:12,920
<font color="#ffffff">Lift your leg.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

488
00:40:19,520 --> 00:40:20,640
<font color="#ffffff">Am I a police officer?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

489
00:40:49,680 --> 00:40:51,280
<font color="#ffffff">All right.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

490
00:40:54,240 --> 00:40:56,240
<font color="#ffffff">Go! Hurry up!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

491
00:40:57,720 --> 00:40:58,880
<font color="#ffffff">Go help your boss!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

492
00:40:58,960 --> 00:41:00,880
<font color="#ffffff">Move it! Go, go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

493
00:41:10,000 --> 00:41:10,840
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, you!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

494
00:41:11,440 --> 00:41:12,360
<font color="#ffffff">How did you get here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

495
00:41:24,520 --> 00:41:25,360
<font color="#ffffff">It's open.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

496
00:41:27,640 --> 00:41:29,240
<font color="#ffffff">-Get out of there!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Go! Everyone.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

497
00:41:30,200 --> 00:41:31,760
<font color="#ffffff">Stick together! Go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

498
00:41:31,840 --> 00:41:33,240
<font color="#ffffff">This way!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

499
00:41:36,400 --> 00:41:37,240
<font color="#ffffff">Keep moving!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

500
00:41:51,840 --> 00:41:52,920
<font color="#ffffff">Now what?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

501
00:41:53,440 --> 00:41:54,520
<font color="#ffffff">We'd better pull back.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

502
00:41:54,600 --> 00:41:55,560
<font color="#ffffff">There's no turning back.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

503
00:41:55,640 --> 00:41:56,960
<font color="#ffffff">Open fire!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

504
00:41:59,840 --> 00:42:01,160
<font color="#ffffff">I'm going in myself.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

505
00:42:01,240 --> 00:42:02,680
<font color="#ffffff">Find Chansuek!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

506
00:42:08,200 --> 00:42:11,800
<font color="#ffffff">Do you see what's right next to you?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

507
00:42:13,200 --> 00:42:16,840
<font color="#ffffff">Keep your left hand steady!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

508
00:42:16,920 --> 00:42:19,360
<font color="#ffffff">Use your right hand to grab a rock.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

509
00:42:22,720 --> 00:42:26,000
<font color="#ffffff">Use it to replace the weight of my foot.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

510
00:42:29,120 --> 00:42:30,640
<font color="#ffffff">The weight should be enough.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

511
00:42:31,360 --> 00:42:33,000
<font color="#ffffff">Take it slow.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

512
00:42:33,080 --> 00:42:35,720
<font color="#ffffff">Just focus on your breathing. Stay calm.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

513
00:42:35,800 --> 00:42:38,640
<font color="#ffffff">I know you can do this.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

514
00:42:48,640 --> 00:42:52,080
<font color="#ffffff">When I lift my foot,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">you put the rock in, okay?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

515
00:42:52,160 --> 00:42:54,360
<font color="#ffffff">-But keep your left hand steady!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Got it.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

516
00:42:56,480 --> 00:42:58,080
<font color="#ffffff">We count together. I'll start.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

517
00:42:58,160 --> 00:43:01,200
<font color="#ffffff">Whether we live or die</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">is in your hands. One…<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

518
00:43:03,520 --> 00:43:04,520
<font color="#ffffff">Two…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

519
00:43:08,600 --> 00:43:10,240
<font color="#ffffff">Three!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

520
00:43:28,000 --> 00:43:30,400
<font color="#ffffff">Release your left hand slowly.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Take it easy.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

521
00:43:41,240 --> 00:43:42,880
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, I did it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

522
00:43:42,960 --> 00:43:44,000
<font color="#ffffff">I actually did it!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

523
00:43:44,080 --> 00:43:46,440
<font color="#ffffff">-I did it!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Yes, you did.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

524
00:43:46,520 --> 00:43:48,800
<font color="#ffffff">You did a great job, Boonrod.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

525
00:43:48,880 --> 00:43:52,200
<font color="#ffffff">Now, I need you to go to Noona.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Go help her!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

526
00:44:03,080 --> 00:44:04,280
<font color="#ffffff">Eat this!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

527
00:44:11,480 --> 00:44:12,720
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

528
00:44:28,200 --> 00:44:30,760
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho, run! The field is blowing up!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

529
00:44:42,040 --> 00:44:43,320
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

530
00:44:43,400 --> 00:44:46,480
<font color="#ffffff">When you were defusing the mine,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">did you say you were a cop?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

531
00:44:46,560 --> 00:44:49,280
<font color="#ffffff">Did I say that? I don't remember.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

532
00:44:49,360 --> 00:44:53,240
<font color="#ffffff">Never mind. Let's just go save Noona!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

533
00:44:56,440 --> 00:44:57,640
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

534
00:44:57,720 --> 00:44:59,080
<font color="#ffffff">Where the hell do you think you're going?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

535
00:44:59,160 --> 00:45:01,240
<font color="#ffffff">Try to leave and you're dead.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

536
00:45:01,320 --> 00:45:02,480
<font color="#ffffff">Sit down!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

537
00:45:03,400 --> 00:45:04,480
<font color="#ffffff">Sit down!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

538
00:45:14,960 --> 00:45:16,120
<font color="#ffffff">Ta!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

539
00:45:28,320 --> 00:45:31,160
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho, get them to safety.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I'm going after Noona!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

540
00:45:31,240 --> 00:45:32,960
<font color="#ffffff">-Go! Now!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Everyone, move!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

541
00:45:33,040 --> 00:45:34,520
<font color="#ffffff">Noona, I'm on my way!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

542
00:45:40,720 --> 00:45:41,800
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

543
00:45:48,160 --> 00:45:50,440
<font color="#ffffff">There's nowhere left to run. I'm scared.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

544
00:45:50,520 --> 00:45:51,840
<font color="#ffffff">What should we do now?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

545
00:45:52,440 --> 00:45:54,200
<font color="#ffffff">The villagers are panicking.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

546
00:45:56,720 --> 00:45:57,800
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, everyone!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

547
00:45:58,600 --> 00:46:01,080
<font color="#ffffff">Does anyone know the Itipiso prayer?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

548
00:46:02,520 --> 00:46:04,320
<font color="#ffffff">Don't think about anything else now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

549
00:46:04,400 --> 00:46:07,720
<font color="#ffffff">Just recite the Itipiso,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">stay focused, and follow me.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

550
00:46:07,800 --> 00:46:08,800
<font color="#ffffff">Are you ready?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

551
00:46:09,760 --> 00:46:10,880
<font color="#ffffff">Let's work together!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

552
00:46:11,440 --> 00:46:12,640
<font color="#ffffff">Okay, let's begin.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

553
00:46:13,160 --> 00:46:15,840
<font color="#ffffff">He is the Blessed One. The Pure One…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

554
00:46:17,800 --> 00:46:19,640
<font color="#ffffff">He is the Blessed One. The Pure One…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

555
00:46:19,720 --> 00:46:20,800
<font color="#ffffff">Everyone, be careful!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

556
00:46:20,880 --> 00:46:22,640
<font color="#ffffff">He is the Blessed One. The Pure One…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

557
00:46:22,720 --> 00:46:26,160
<font color="#ffffff">The Perfectly Enlightened One,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">endowed with…<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

558
00:46:31,560 --> 00:46:32,560
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho, hurry!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

559
00:46:37,040 --> 00:46:37,880
<font color="#ffffff">Quick!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

560
00:46:38,800 --> 00:46:40,560
<font color="#ffffff">Hey.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

561
00:46:41,160 --> 00:46:42,000
<font color="#ffffff">Come with me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

562
00:46:43,960 --> 00:46:44,960
<font color="#ffffff">You're a bad person.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

563
00:46:45,720 --> 00:46:47,320
<font color="#ffffff">Go! Whoa!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

564
00:46:47,840 --> 00:46:48,840
<font color="#ffffff">What the heck?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

565
00:46:49,360 --> 00:46:51,240
<font color="#ffffff">-Come with me!</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Like hell I will!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

566
00:46:52,080 --> 00:46:53,120
<font color="#ffffff">Are you deaf?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

567
00:47:07,000 --> 00:47:07,920
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

568
00:47:15,880 --> 00:47:16,800
<font color="#ffffff">Sit down!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

569
00:47:16,880 --> 00:47:18,800
<font color="#ffffff">NEXT EPISODE</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

570
00:47:18,880 --> 00:47:20,360
<font color="#ffffff">Please, just let me go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

571
00:47:20,960 --> 00:47:22,760
<font color="#ffffff">I'm just a reporter! Don't do this!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

572
00:47:22,840 --> 00:47:24,840
<font color="#ffffff">Where is the diamond?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

573
00:47:27,760 --> 00:47:28,800
<font color="#ffffff">You two, come with me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

574
00:47:30,360 --> 00:47:32,800
<font color="#ffffff">What's your business here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

575
00:47:32,880 --> 00:47:35,240
<font color="#ffffff">-I suggest that you…</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Do you remember me?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

576
00:47:37,000 --> 00:47:39,360
<font color="#ffffff">I have two fond memories.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

577
00:47:39,960 --> 00:47:41,120
<font color="#ffffff">What are they?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

578
00:47:41,720 --> 00:47:44,160
<font color="#ffffff">One is of Luang Pho Suea…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

579
00:47:46,440 --> 00:47:47,520
<font color="#ffffff">The other…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

580
00:47:48,840 --> 00:47:49,920
<font color="#ffffff">is of you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

581
00:51:05,240 --> 00:51:10,240
<font color="#ffffff">Subtitle translation by: Akekaphong C.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>
